# v303 — OCCURRENCE READINESS (ATL-1)
# Three new resolvers compose the canonical readiness verdict bottom-up from
# responsibility_state; projection_occurrence_brief is REPLACED to carry it.
#
# The brief's identity signature does not change and it remains occurrence_brief
# v1, so projection_occurrences_for_operational_day's composed version guard is
# untouched and never fires. projection_occurrence_brief is NOT re-declared here:
# v292b declares it where it is first created, and the chain covers it — the same
# rule v297 applied to occurrence_current_venue.
release          v303
migration        supabase/v303_readiness.sql
migration_source repository
min_release      v302

function         occurrence_phase(p_occurrence uuid, p_now timestamp with time zone)
function         occurrence_department_readiness(p_occurrence uuid, p_now timestamp with time zone)
function         occurrence_readiness(p_occurrence uuid, p_now timestamp with time zone)
function         v303_readiness()
